# Tong's art, copied from deion_assets by scripts/sync_sprites.py — the only way
# art enters this game. Run it from this repo's root:
#
#     python3 deion_assets/scripts/sync_sprites.py .
#
# and `--check` to prove the copies still match the pinned commit below (the
# working set's scripts/check-sprite-sync.sh runs that over every game).
#
# The quarantined `ai_` prefix stays on the copies (D3): a paid build's
# check_no_ai_assets.sh gate must still find them until Jesse's cleanup pass
# turns them into hand-cleaned masters in deion_assets/sidescroller/.
#
# deion_assets e01ad7b8b326125ca7b4ce990bdba94585bee907
